    a: "Different size and application targets within the Chewblet platform family. **7Series** and **25Series** are compact countertop or undercounter Chewblet machines for lower-volume operations: office break rooms, small clinics, dental offices, executive suites. **Maestro Plus** is the restaurant and beverage version of the dispenser platform — Symphony platform mechanical architecture minus healthcare-specific sanitization features, common at higher-end LA restaurants, hotel pool bars, and cocktail-focused operations where Chewblet ice is part of the menu specification. **Symphony Plus** is the healthcare-focused ice and water dispenser line with antimicrobial agitator, optional UV sanitization, and Sanitizer 2.0 cleaning cycle — common at Cedars-Sinai, UCLA, Kaiser, and most LA-area dialysis centers. **Ice Pro Chewblet** is Follett's medium-volume countertop Chewblet machine. Our techs at Same Day Appliance Repair service all four lines."
  },
